  unitName: Dark Princess Dia
  unitId: 10374
  unitNumber: 531
  description: A mage raised in the outskirts of the Agni Empire. One day, a letter
    of summons arrived from the Atharva Republic, claiming her late grandmother had
    leaked imperial secrets. Hoping to clear her grandmother's name, she headed to
    the capital along with her faithful dragon Grazool. There, she had the shocking
    realization that her grandmother had been a famous Atharvaian sorceress. Through
    fighting off the gods' attacks in this complex emotional state, she realized
    she was far superior to any normal human mage.
  summonDesc: I call the shots around here.<br>You didn't summon me...<br>I summoned
    you!
  fusionDesc: It feels stuffy in here...<br>Either 'cause Grazool got bigger...<br>Or
    my outfit got tighter...<br>
  evoDesc: Think I'm pretty tough?<br>That means my grandma was<br>incredible!
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
